<title>USA: U.S. equity options volume in Apr up 27 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>U.S. equity options volume in Apr up 27 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. equity options volume in April totalled 21,449,524 contracts, up 27 percent from 16,873,421 in April 1996, the Options Industry Council (OIC) said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The OIC said average daily volume in April was 974,978 contracts compared to 943,809 contracts in March.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
